{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"647890633763323924","content":"\"It *is* pretty cool,\" Astella responds, not turning to face you. \"What's going on upstairs?\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T19:59:39.437000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736674046539857961","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"647890633763323924","content":"\"I haven't the slightest idea... Can't move around too fast anymore, figured i'd go check it out after I check here... Looking for a friend still.\" His left hand scratching the back of his head as he looks around, still trying to take everything in","created_at":"2020-07-25T20:01:59.782000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736674635189583904","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"647890633763323924","content":"\"This place could be a hell of a lot more efficient. Shame they don't use cantrip-loopers. It's quite easy for an inventor...\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T20:04:24.074000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736675240393965648","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"647890633763323924","content":"Ebuc sighs, grasping his right shoulder with his left hand \"can't say that ive ever heard of cantrip-loopers, what are they like?\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T20:05:35.910000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736675541695987852","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"647890633763323924","content":"\"They're simple. What's better are elemental-absorption-loopers. You set up a bunch of triggerers, often as tiny mechanical servants, equip them all with scrolls of *Absorb Elements*. You give them the command to use it if they are hit with a shock, and when they use it they hit the one to their left. You send a shock in there and in a few seconds you can generate energy, magnetic and electric, in incredible amounts. There's a lot magic can do in tandem with science.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T20:08:59.074000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736676393827565659","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"647890633763323924","content":"Ebuc writes all this down in a scroll, quickly","created_at":"2020-07-25T20:11:14.497000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736676961832665149","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"647890633763323924","content":"\"Or they could just teach a few mechanical servants to do this:\" They light their hand with electricity through *Shocking Grasp*. \"You can do this as much as you want and it can power a lot. They could also just enchant this thing with *levitate* instead of weighing it down with ballasts...\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T20:13:15.251000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736677468311781398","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
